# Daily active users

Three platforms on one continuous domain. The shape of the change is the
point; the individual magnitudes are secondary, which is what makes this a
line chart rather than a bar chart.

```mdv line
title: Daily active users
x: date
y: [ios, android, web]
curve: monotone
label: end
format: table
---
date       |  ios | android |  web
2026-07-01 | 4210 |    5180 | 2240
2026-07-02 | 4380 |    5240 | 2190
2026-07-03 | 4120 |    5310 | 2260
2026-07-04 | 4490 |    5402 | 2310
2026-07-05 | 4660 |    5388 | 2288
```
